    "text": "电影与音乐\n\n让我们用电影与音乐开启新的一年吧！\n\n通常我因为电影而接触其配乐，并因配乐而永远的记住这部电影。似乎越经典的电影，其大师级的配乐越令人无法忘却。\n\n以下为我特别喜爱的四部电影，也是我反复收听的四张原声大碟。\n\n1.美国往事(Once Upon a Time in America)\n\n导演: 塞尔乔·莱昂内 (Sergio Leone)\n配乐作者: 埃尼奥·莫里康内 (Ennio Morricone)\n\n2.教父(The Godfather)\n\n导演: 弗朗西斯·福特·科波拉 (Francis Ford Coppola)\n配乐作者: 尼诺·罗塔 (Nino Rota)\n\n3.指环王 (The Lord of the Rings)\n\n导演: 彼得·杰克逊 (Peter Jackson)\n配乐作者: 霍华德·肖 (Howard Shore)\n\n4.辛德勒名单(Schindler's List)\n\n导演: 史蒂文·斯皮尔伯格 (Steven Spielberg)\n配乐作者: 约翰·威廉姆斯 (John Williams)\n\n用图片呈现音乐是件挺有难度的事情。感谢 @Gdgtify 的创意，他使用了黑胶唱片来呈现音乐相关的微缩模型。\n\n我略作修改，将其与电影中的“原声大碟”相结合，在突出电影配乐的同时也可以借助电影中的场景将人带入电影之中。\n\n提示词\n\n专集：辛德勒名单\n/// Usage Examples (Reference Only) ///\nExample 1 (Sci-Fi): \nALBUM: \"The Dark Side of the Moon\"; \nSCENES: a tiny prism refracting light into a rainbow city, miniature floating clocks, surreal lunar surface; \nNEEDLE: a retro spaceship.\n\nExample 2 (Movie/OST): \nALBUM: \"The Legend of 1900\"; \nSCENES: tempestuous ocean waves made of vinyl, a grand piano on a ship deck, a jazz band in the grooves; \nNEEDLE: a 1920s classic convertible car.\n/// End of Examples ///\n\nA detailed macro photograph of a vintage turntable with a spinning vinyl record. The black vinyl grooves of the record rise up to sculpt an intricate, miniature circular diorama representing the themes and imagery of the classic album {INSERT_ALBUM_NAME}. The landscape built from the grooves features {INSERT_SPECIFIC_SCENES_AND_ELEMENTS}. A tiny, detailed model of a {INSERT_NEEDLE_OBJECT} serves as the record needle, navigating the curving, canyon-like \"roads\" of the vinyl grooves. The record label in the center is clearly visible. The scene is lit with atmospheric, cinematic lighting, highlighting the textures of the vinyl and the miniature world.",
